|notes=All title, uniqueness, destiny, lore, Warrior icon, numerical stats, asterisk deploy field and game text are visible on this full gallery image. Rarity U2 follows the official set catalogue. Landspeed 1 is rule-derived, not printed on the face; the Glossary (1998), pages 34 and 82, supplies the character default. The literal lore identifies him as a Jawa scout; the later Rule of Three explicitly uses this same lore to distinguish an unrelated stormtrooper reference, not to make Het a stormtrooper.<ref>[[:File:Decipher_Glossary_1998.pdf|Decipher Glossary]] (November 1998), pages 34, 68, 77 and 82; [[:File:SWCCG_2023_AdvancedRulebook.pdf|Advanced Rulebook]] (2023), pages 178–180.</ref>
